  "vv45:1.1": "Abhikkantena vaṇṇena ",
  "vv45:1.2": "yā tvaṃ tiṭṭhasi devate obhāsentī disā sabbā osadhī viya tārakā, [=45].2 Kena t' etādiso vaṇṇo kena te idha-m-ijjhati uppajjanti ca te bhogā ye keci manaso piyā. [=45].3 Pucchāmi taṃ devi mahānubhāve manussabhūtā kim akāsi puññaṃ kenāsi evaṃ jalitānubhāvā ",
  "vv45:1.3": "vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatī ti . [=45].4 ",
  "vv45:2.1": "Sā devatā attamanā ",
  "vv45:2.2": "Moggallānena pucchitā pañhaṃ puṭṭhā viyākāsi ",
  "vv45:2.3": "yassa kammass' idaṃ phalaṃ: [=45].5 ",
  "vv45:3.1": "Indīvarānaṃ hatthakam ahaṃ adāsiṃ ",
  "vv45:3.2": "bhikkhuno piṇḍāya carantassa ",
  "vv45:3.3": "Esikānaṃ unnatasmiṃ ",
  "vv45:3.4": "nagaravare Paṇṇakate ramme. [=45].6 ",
  "vv45:4.1": "Tena m' etādiso vaṇṇo ",
  "vv45:4.2": "tena me idha-m-ijjhati uppajjanti ca me bhogā ye keci manaso piyā. [=45].7 Akkhāmi te bhikkhu mahānubhāva manussabhūtā yam akāsi puññaṃ ten' amhi evaṃ jalitānubhāvā ",
  "vv45:4.3": "vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī ti. [=45].8-11 ",
